<title>USA: PaineWebber wins $34 Colorado Housing Finance.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber wins $34 Colorado Housing Finance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it won $34 million of Colorado Housing and Finance Authority single-family housing revenue refunding bonds, 1996 Series AA, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.600 percent.</p>
</text>
